    Do not use vapoursynth.toml to discover the python interpreter
    
    We use either
    
    1. the interpreter the package was built with, hardcoded
    
    2. the wrapped interpreter of the current environment,
       discovered using the NIX_PYTHONEXECUTABLE variable

